  "description": "Enter the intricate world of §bPetrochemistry§r! This vast field transforms §oCarbon Compounds§r (like §eOil§r and §eWood Byproducts§r) into precise §aChemicals§r. These are vital for crafting everything from advanced §dPlastics§r to durable §dEpoxy Resins§r.

Your first breakthrough: producing §aEthylene§r. This essential building block will allow you to synthesize your first plastic: §aPolyethylene§r!

